{"seq":2,"slug":"type-system-and-validation","title":"类型系统与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/core-concepts/type-system-and-validation","wordCount":1093,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型系统与验证\">类型系统与验证</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WebAssembly 的类型系统刻意保持精简：数值/向量类型只有 <code>i32</code>/<code>i64</code>/<code>f32</code>/<code>f64</code>/<code>v128</code>，引用类型只有 <code>funcref</code>/<code>externref</code>，没有原生布尔与字符串——这正是 JS↔WASM 边界需要胶水代码的根源。控制流指令（<code>block</code>/<code>loop</code>/<code>if</code>）带有<strong>块类型签名</strong>，保证结构化控制流中每条路径的栈类型一致。实例化之前，验证器对每个函数体做<strong>单遍抽象解释</strong>，逐条指令推导类型栈，在 O(n) 内完成全部类型检查；验证通过的模块据此获得内存安全、类型安全、控制流完整性与确定性执行等强保证。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"值类型\">值类型</h2><p>WebAssembly 定义了一组严格的值类型，所有操作数、局部变量和函数参数都必须属于这些类型之一。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>i32</code></td>\n<td>32 位</td>\n<td>32 位整数</td>\n<td>通用整数运算、指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i64</code></td>\n<td>64 位</td>\n<td>64 位整数</td>\n<td>大整数运算、时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>f32</code></td>\n<td>32 位</td>\n<td>IEEE 754 单精度浮点</td>\n<td>图形计算、近似值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>f64</code></td>\n<td>64 位</td>\n<td>IEEE 754 双精度浮点</td>\n<td>科学计算、精确浮点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>v128</code></td>\n<td>128 位</td>\n<td>SIMD 向量类型</td>\n<td>并行数据处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wat\" data-code=\"(module&#10;  (func $type_demo&#10;    (local $int32 i32)&#10;    (local $int64 i64)&#10;    (local $float32 f32)&#10;    (local $float64 f64)&#10;&#10;    (local.set $int32 (i32.const 42))&#10;    (local.set $int64 (i64.const 9999999999))&#10;    (local.set $float32 (f32.const 3.14))&#10;    (local.set $float64 (f64.const 2.718281828))&#10;  )&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $type_demo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (local $int32 i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (local $int64 i64)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (local $float32 f32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (local $float64 f64)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (local.set $int32 (i32.const 42))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (local.set $int64 (i64.const 9999999999))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (local.set $float32 (f32.const 3.14))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (local.set $float64 (f64.const 2.718281828))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    NUMTYPE[数值类型] --&gt; I32[i32]&#10;    NUMTYPE --&gt; I64[i64]&#10;    NUMTYPE --&gt; F32[f32]&#10;    NUMTYPE --&gt; F64[f64]&#10;    VECTYPE[向量类型] --&gt; V128[v128]&#10;    REFTYPE[引用类型] --&gt; FUNCREF[funcref]&#10;    REFTYPE --&gt; EXTERNREF[externref]&#10;    VALTYPE[值类型] --&gt; NUMTYPE&#10;    VALTYPE --&gt; VECTYPE&#10;    VALTYPE --&gt; REFTYPE\">graph TD\n    NUMTYPE[数值类型] --&gt; I32[i32]\n    NUMTYPE --&gt; I64[i64]\n    NUMTYPE --&gt; F32[f32]\n    NUMTYPE --&gt; F64[f64]\n    VECTYPE[向量类型] --&gt; V128[v128]\n    REFTYPE[引用类型] --&gt; FUNCREF[funcref]\n    REFTYPE --&gt; EXTERNREF[externref]\n    VALTYPE[值类型] --&gt; NUMTYPE\n    VALTYPE --&gt; VECTYPE\n    VALTYPE --&gt; REFTYPE</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WASM 没有原生的布尔类型和字符串类型。布尔值用 <code>i32</code>（0/非0）表示，字符串通过线性内存中的字节序列加长度/指针来传递。这是 JS↔WASM 边界需要胶水代码的根本原因。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"引用类型\">引用类型</h2><p>WASM 2.0 引入了引用类型（Reference Types），使模块能够持有和传递不透明的宿主对象引用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wat\" data-code=\"(module&#10;  (table $t 10 externref)&#10;&#10;  (func $store_ref (param $idx i32) (param $ref externref)&#10;    local.get $idx&#10;    local.get $ref&#10;    table.set $t&#10;  )&#10;&#10;  (func $load_ref (param $idx i32) (result externref)&#10;    local.get $idx&#10;    table.get $t&#10;  )&#10;&#10;  (export &quot;storeRef&quot; (func $store_ref))&#10;  (export &quot;loadRef&quot; (func $load_ref))&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (table $t 10 externref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $store_ref (param $idx i32) (param $ref externref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $idx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $ref</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    table.set $t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $load_ref (param $idx i32) (result externref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local.get $idx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    table.get $t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (export \"storeRef\" (func $store_ref))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (export \"loadRef\" (func $load_ref))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引用类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>可存储位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>funcref</code></td>\n<td>WASM 函数引用</td>\n<td>函数表、局部变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>externref</code></td>\n<td>任意宿主对象引用（对 WASM 不透明）</td>\n<td>函数表、局部变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const table = new WebAssembly.Table({ initial: 10, element: &#39;externref&#39; });&#10;const instance = await WebAssembly.instantiate(module, {});&#10;&#10;instance.exports.storeRef(0, document.createElement(&#39;div&#39;));&#10;const ref = instance.exports.loadRef(0);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ initial: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, element: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'externref'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">instantiate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">instance.exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">storeRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'div'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance.exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>externref</code> 是实现 WASM 直接操作 DOM 的基础。在引入 externref 之前，WASM 只能通过整数句柄间接引用宿主对象，需要在 JS 侧维护一个映射表。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"块类型与结构化控制流\">块类型与结构化控制流</h2><p>WASM 的控制流指令（<code>block</code>、<code>loop</code>、<code>if</code>）都拥有类型签名，称为<strong>块类型（Block Type）</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wat\" data-code=\"(module&#10;  (func $block_types (param $x i32) (result i32)&#10;    ;; block 可以产生结果值&#10;    (block $outer (result i32)&#10;      (block $inner (result i32)&#10;        (local.get $x)&#10;        (i32.const 10)&#10;        (i32.gt_s)&#10;        (if (result i32)&#10;          (then (i32.const 1))&#10;          (else (i32.const 0))&#10;        )&#10;      )&#10;    )&#10;  )&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $block_types (param $x i32) (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ;; block 可以产生结果值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (block $outer (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (block $inner (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (local.get $x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (i32.const 10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (i32.gt_s)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (if (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          (then (i32.const 1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          (else (i32.const 0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    BLOCK[&quot;block (result i32)&quot;] --&gt; BODY[&quot;函数体指令序列&quot;]&#10;    BODY --&gt; BR[&quot;br $label → 跳出 block&quot;]&#10;    BODY --&gt; END[&quot;end → 隐式跳出&quot;]&#10;    LOOP[&quot;loop (result i32)&quot;] --&gt; LBODY[&quot;循环体指令序列&quot;]&#10;    LBODY --&gt; LBRI[&quot;br $label → 跳回 loop 开头&quot;]&#10;    LBODY --&gt; LEND[&quot;end → 跳出 loop&quot;]&#10;    IF[&quot;if (result i32)&quot;] --&gt; THEN[&quot;then 分支&quot;]&#10;    IF --&gt; ELSE[&quot;else 分支&quot;]\">graph TD\n    BLOCK[\"block (result i32)\"] --&gt; BODY[\"函数体指令序列\"]\n    BODY --&gt; BR[\"br $label → 跳出 block\"]\n    BODY --&gt; END[\"end → 隐式跳出\"]\n    LOOP[\"loop (result i32)\"] --&gt; LBODY[\"循环体指令序列\"]\n    LBODY --&gt; LBRI[\"br $label → 跳回 loop 开头\"]\n    LBODY --&gt; LEND[\"end → 跳出 loop\"]\n    IF[\"if (result i32)\"] --&gt; THEN[\"then 分支\"]\n    IF --&gt; ELSE[\"else 分支\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制流指令</th>\n<th>块类型作用</th>\n<th><code>br</code> 目标行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>block</code></td>\n<td>定义结果类型</td>\n<td>跳到 block 末尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>loop</code></td>\n<td>定义结果类型</td>\n<td>跳到 loop 开头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>if</code></td>\n<td>定义两分支结果类型</td>\n<td>跳到 if 末尾</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"验证算法\">验证算法</h2><p>WASM 在实例化之前执行完整的类型验证，确保模块的每条指令都类型正确。这是 WASM 安全保证的核心支柱。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Loader as 加载器&#10;    participant Validator as 验证器&#10;    participant Engine as 执行引擎&#10;&#10;    Loader-&gt;&gt;Validator: 提交二进制模块&#10;    Validator-&gt;&gt;Validator: 解码段结构&#10;    Validator-&gt;&gt;Validator: 验证类型段&#10;    Validator-&gt;&gt;Validator: 验证函数签名&#10;    Validator-&gt;&gt;Validator: 逐函数验证指令序列&#10;    alt 验证通过&#10;        Validator-&gt;&gt;Engine: 交付已验证模块&#10;        Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 编译并实例化&#10;    else 验证失败&#10;        Validator--&gt;&gt;Loader: 抛出 CompileError&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Loader as 加载器\n    participant Validator as 验证器\n    participant Engine as 执行引擎\n\n    Loader-&gt;&gt;Validator: 提交二进制模块\n    Validator-&gt;&gt;Validator: 解码段结构\n    Validator-&gt;&gt;Validator: 验证类型段\n    Validator-&gt;&gt;Validator: 验证函数签名\n    Validator-&gt;&gt;Validator: 逐函数验证指令序列\n    alt 验证通过\n        Validator-&gt;&gt;Engine: 交付已验证模块\n        Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 编译并实例化\n    else 验证失败\n        Validator--&gt;&gt;Loader: 抛出 CompileError\n    end</pre><p>验证器对每个函数体执行<strong>抽象解释</strong>——维护一个类型栈，逐条指令推导栈上类型变化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn validate_i32_add(type_stack: &amp;mut Vec&lt;ValType&gt;) -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let b = type_stack.pop().ok_or(Error::StackUnderflow)?;&#10;    let a = type_stack.pop().ok_or(Error::StackUnderflow)?;&#10;    if a != ValType::I32 || b != ValType::I32 {&#10;        return Err(Error::TypeMismatch);&#10;    }&#10;    type_stack.push(ValType::I32);&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn validate_i32_add(type_stack: &#x26;mut Vec&#x3C;ValType>) -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let b = type_stack.pop().ok_or(Error::StackUnderflow)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let a = type_stack.pop().ok_or(Error::StackUnderflow)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if a != ValType::I32 || b != ValType::I32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Err(Error::TypeMismatch);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type_stack.push(ValType::I32);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证项目</th>\n<th>检查内容</th>\n<th>失败结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型栈一致性</td>\n<td>每条指令的操作数类型匹配</td>\n<td>CompileError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数签名匹配</td>\n<td>调用目标的参数/返回值类型正确</td>\n<td>CompileError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存访问合法</td>\n<td>load/store 的对齐和偏移在声明范围内</td>\n<td>CompileError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支目标合法</td>\n<td>br/br_if 指向有效的块标签</td>\n<td>CompileError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈高度一致</td>\n<td>所有路径到达 end 时栈高度相同</td>\n<td>CompileError</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 验证算法是单遍的，时间复杂度与模块大小成线性关系。这意味着即使是数 MB 的 WASM 模块也能在毫秒级完成验证——这对 Web 场景至关重要。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型安全执行\">类型安全执行</h2><p>通过验证后的 WASM 模块在执行时享有以下类型安全保证：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>保证类别</th>\n<th>具体内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存安全</td>\n<td>所有内存访问都经过边界检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>不存在类型混淆或强制转换漏洞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制流完整性</td>\n<td>间接调用必须通过类型签名验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈安全</td>\n<td>不可能出现栈溢出攻击或栈数据泄露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性</td>\n<td>相同输入必然产生相同输出（除浮点NaN）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn safe_divide(a: f64, b: f64) -&gt; Result&lt;f64, JsValue&gt; {&#10;    if b == 0.0 {&#10;        Err(JsValue::from_str(&quot;Division by zero&quot;))&#10;    } else {&#10;        Ok(a / b)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn safe_divide(a: f64, b: f64) -> Result&#x3C;f64, JsValue> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if b == 0.0 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(JsValue::from_str(\"Division by zero\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(a / b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    INPUT[&quot;WASM 二进制&quot;] --&gt; VALIDATE[&quot;类型验证&quot;]&#10;    VALIDATE --&gt;|通过| COMPILE[&quot;JIT 编译&quot;]&#10;    VALIDATE --&gt;|失败| REJECT[&quot;拒绝加载&quot;]&#10;    COMPILE --&gt; EXECUTE[&quot;安全执行&quot;]&#10;    EXECUTE --&gt;|内存越界| TRAP[&quot;trap 终止&quot;]&#10;    EXECUTE --&gt;|类型不匹配| TRAP&#10;    EXECUTE --&gt;|正常完成| RESULT[&quot;返回结果&quot;]\">graph LR\n    INPUT[\"WASM 二进制\"] --&gt; VALIDATE[\"类型验证\"]\n    VALIDATE --&gt;|通过| COMPILE[\"JIT 编译\"]\n    VALIDATE --&gt;|失败| REJECT[\"拒绝加载\"]\n    COMPILE --&gt; EXECUTE[\"安全执行\"]\n    EXECUTE --&gt;|内存越界| TRAP[\"trap 终止\"]\n    EXECUTE --&gt;|类型不匹配| TRAP\n    EXECUTE --&gt;|正常完成| RESULT[\"返回结果\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((类型系统与验证))&#10;    值类型&#10;      i32/i64/f32/f64&#10;      v128 SIMD&#10;      无原生字符串&#10;    引用类型&#10;      funcref 函数引用&#10;      externref 宿主引用&#10;      GC 提案扩展中&#10;    块类型&#10;      block/loop/if 签名&#10;      结构化控制流&#10;      无任意 goto&#10;    验证算法&#10;      单遍线性验证&#10;      抽象类型栈&#10;      编译前完成&#10;    类型安全执行&#10;      内存边界检查&#10;      控制流完整性&#10;      确定性语义\">mindmap\n  root((类型系统与验证))\n    值类型\n      i32/i64/f32/f64\n      v128 SIMD\n      无原生字符串\n    引用类型\n      funcref 函数引用\n      externref 宿主引用\n      GC 提案扩展中\n    块类型\n      block/loop/if 签名\n      结构化控制流\n      无任意 goto\n    验证算法\n      单遍线性验证\n      抽象类型栈\n      编译前完成\n    类型安全执行\n      内存边界检查\n      控制流完整性\n      确定性语义</pre><ul>\n<li>WASM 定义了 5 种数值/向量类型（<code>i32</code>/<code>i64</code>/<code>f32</code>/<code>f64</code>/<code>v128</code>）和 2 种引用类型（<code>funcref</code>/<code>externref</code>）。</li>\n<li>块类型为 <code>block</code>/<code>loop</code>/<code>if</code> 提供类型签名，确保结构化控制流中每条路径的类型一致性。</li>\n<li>验证算法通过<strong>单遍抽象解释</strong>在实例化前完成所有类型检查，时间复杂度为 O(n)。</li>\n<li>验证通过后的模块享有内存安全、类型安全、控制流完整性和确定性执行等强保证。</li>\n<li>这套&quot;先验证后执行&quot;的模型是 WASM 能够在不信任环境中安全运行的根本保障。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型系统与验证","id":"类型系统与验证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"值类型","id":"值类型"},{"level":2,"text":"引用类型","id":"引用类型"},{"level":2,"text":"块类型与结构化控制流","id":"块类型与结构化控制流"},{"level":2,"text":"验证算法","id":"验证算法"},{"level":2,"text":"类型安全执行","id":"类型安全执行"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WASM 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/core-concepts/wasm-architecture"},"next":{"title":"二进制与文本格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/core-concepts/binary-and-text-format"}}